            * u_xlat0.xzw + u_xlat1.xyz;\n    u_xlat15 = dot(u_xlat0.xyz, vec3(0.298999995,
            0.587000012, 0.114));\n    u_xlat0.xyz = (-vec3(u_xlat15)) + u_xlat0.xyz;\n   
            SV_Target0.xyz = vec3(vec3(_Saturation, _Saturation, _Saturation)) *
            u_xlat0.xyz + vec3(u_xlat15);\n    return;\n}\n\n"
